msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Para sa CA bundle mode: absolute path sa poller patungo sa isang PEM file na hindi maaaring sulatan ng iba."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Para sa pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 ng pampublikong susi ng BMC, bilang sha256//... o ang mismong hash lamang. Mabibigo ang nabagong susi hanggang sa ma-update ito."

