msgstr "%s Default %d, mula %d hanggang %d."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Vault ng Kredensyal"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Vault Key File"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Absolute path patungo sa 32-byte na susi na nag-e-encrypt sa mga nakaimbak na password ng BMC. Ikaw mismo ang gumawa nito, sa labas ng web root, nababasa lamang ng web server at poller user, sa isang direktoryo na tanging root at ang user na iyon lamang ang makakasulat; hindi kailanman ito ginagawa o sinusulatan ng plugin. I-back up ito kasama ng database: kung wala ito, kakailanganing ilagay muli ang mga nakaimbak na password."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Collector"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Agwat ng Pagkolekta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Mga segundo sa pagitan ng mga pagbasa sa bawat BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Agwat ng Muling Pagtuklas"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Mga segundo sa pagitan ng mga buong pagtuklas ng resource ng bawat BMC. Agad ding muling tinutuklas ang isang BMC kapag nawala o nagbago ng uri ang isang kilalang resource."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Oras na Badyet ng Collector"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Mga segundong maaaring gugulin ng isang pagtakbo ng collector bago ito huminto sa pagsisimula ng mga bagong BMC. Panatilihin itong mas mababa kaysa sa agwat ng poller; magpapatuloy ang mga hindi natapos na BMC sa susunod na pagtakbo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "Mga BMC na sabay-sabay na binabasa. Ang bawat BMC ay binabasa ng isang worker sa bawat pagkakataon."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Mga Collector Worker"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout sa Pagkonekta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Mga segundong pinapayagan para sa koneksyon ng TCP at TLS handshake sa isang BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Timeout ng Kahilingan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Mga segundong pinapayagan para sa isang buong kahilingan sa isang BMC, kabilang ang koneksyon."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB na tinatanggap sa isang response body ng BMC; tinatanggihan ang mas malaking tugon."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Pinakamalaking Laki ng Tugon"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Pagiging Bago"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Mga agwat ng pangongolekta na pagkatapos nito ay ipinapakita ang isang pagbasa bilang naantala."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Naantala Pagkatapos Ng"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Mga agwat ng pangongolekta na pagkatapos nito ay luma na ang isang pagbasa at nagbabasa bilang hindi kilala. Palaging mas mataas nang hindi bababa sa isa kaysa sa Naantala Pagkatapos Ng."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Luma Na Pagkatapos ng"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "I-uninstall"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Panatilihin ang mga Talahanayan ng Plugin kapag Nag-uninstall"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Kapag nakatsek, pinapanatili ng pag-uninstall ng plugin ang BMC registry, mga naka-encrypt na password, at reading cache nito. Alisin ang tsek upang tanggalin ang mga ito ng pag-uninstall. Hindi kailanman pinapakialaman ng pag-uninstall ang mga Cacti device, graph, o BMC, kabilang ang mga device na ginawa ng plugin."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "I-verify gamit ang system CA store"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "I-verify gamit ang isang CA bundle file"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Naka-pin na pampublikong susi (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Huwag i-verify (hindi ligtas)"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "You do not have access to the Cacti device of this BMC."
msgstr "Wala kang access sa Cacti device ng BMC na ito."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC could not be saved."
msgstr "Hindi nai-save ang BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC was saved."
msgstr "Nai-save ang BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Tinanggal ang BMC at ang naka-cache na data nito. Iniwan sa lugar ang Cacti device nito."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Na-clear ang backoff at mga pinigilang pagkabigo; babasahin ng collector ang BMC sa susunod na pagtakbo nito."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Ang pagdaragdag ng mga device at graph ay nangangailangan ng pahintulot sa pamamahala ng device ng Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Tinanggal ang device ng BMC na ito. Pumili muna ng ibang device, o wala, sa form ng BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data queries were indexed again and %d graphs were added."
msgstr "Muling na-index ang mga data query at %d mga graph ang naidagdag."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "Ginawa ang device kasama ang mga Redfish graph nito."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Installing the Redfish templates needs Cacti's Import Templates permission."
msgstr "Ang pag-install ng mga Redfish template ay nangangailangan ng pahintulot na Mag-import ng mga Template ng Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are installed."
msgstr "Naka-install ang mga Redfish template."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed. The health page shows why."
msgstr "Hindi ma-install ang mga Redfish template. Ipinapakita sa pahina ng kalusugan kung bakit."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The import could not be saved; nothing was imported."
msgstr "Hindi nai-save ang pag-import; walang na-import."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs were imported."
msgstr "%d mga BMC ang na-import."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "This credential is used by a BMC on a Cacti device you do not have access to, so it cannot be changed here."
msgstr "Ginagamit ang credential na ito ng isang BMC sa isang Cacti device na wala kang access, kaya hindi ito maaaring baguhin dito."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Name: another credential already uses this name."
msgstr "Pangalan: ginagamit na ng ibang credential ang pangalang ito."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "User Name: enter 1 to 255 characters without control characters."
msgstr "User Name: maglagay ng 1 hanggang 255 character na walang mga control character."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Password: enter the password of the BMC account."
msgstr "Password: ilagay ang password ng BMC account."

#: redfish_credentials.php
#, php-format
msgid "The credential was saved, but the password was not stored: %s"
msgstr "Nai-save ang credential, ngunit hindi naimbak ang password: %s"

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential could not be saved."
msgstr "Hindi nai-save ang credential."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was saved."
msgstr "Nai-save ang credential."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential and its stored password were deleted."
msgstr "Tinanggal ang credential at ang nakaimbak na password nito."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was not deleted. A credential in use by a BMC cannot be deleted."
msgstr "Hindi tinanggal ang credential. Hindi maaaring tanggalin ang isang credential na ginagamit ng isang BMC."

